<title>UK: Cookson sells pigment businesses to Hoechst.</title>
<headline>Cookson sells pigment businesses to Hoechst.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>British industrial materials group Cookson Group Plc said on Wednesday it would sell its pigments businesses to Hoechst Celanese Corp for 11.5 million stg.</p>
<p>Hoechst Celanese is a unit of Hoechst AG.</p>
